# Internal Website Access

When accessing Amazon internal websites through a browser, load and follow the `browser-automation` skill and connect to the user's running Google Chrome over CDP. Do not use Codex's built-in browser, because internal access depends on extensions installed in the user's Chrome profile. This restriction does not apply to dedicated MCP or API access.

